<title>USA: NYSE official volume.</title>
<headline>NYSE official volume.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said its official volume for Thursday totalled 460,480,590 shares compared to 487,183,610 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official figures were delayed briefly due to reporting difficulties at the exchange.</p>
<p>Earlier, the exchange reported preliminary volume of 464,040,000 shares.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
